  "title": "Funnel into a loop",
  "caption": "The talk funnels a broad hunt through pseudoscience down into one named failure, 'Cargo Cult Science', crystallizes a single rule ('you are the easiest person to fool'), fans that rule out into real case studies, then loops back at the end to the same demand for honesty it opened with.",
