          "w": 300,
          "h": 70,
          "text": "Mysticism, ESP, Geller's keys — nothing works",
          "size": "sm",
          "detail": "Isolation tanks, Esalen, reflexology, and Uri Geller's key-bending all failed to show anything real.",
          "tone": 1,
          "block": "spya-q4502k"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "n3",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 230,
